  "sourceTitle": "Abnormal AI: Amazon Bedrock AgentCore for agentic email security at scale",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2fd3db415a6c7756a1050e3590149e70b8fa299c0408dda267e0cf0baa547eb8",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-15T00:27:36.531468Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T13:48:46.984543Z",
  "totalBlocks": 66,
  "translatedBlocks": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60b1286d1c7d8a80",
      "translationZh": "AI 代理现在每天在生产环境中以数十亿次操作的规模运行，并且出现了一种反复出现的架构模式：代理需要一个计算临时存储区。不仅用于编码任务，还用于数据聚合、分析、验证以及任何仅靠语义推理不足以完成的工作流。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86df8ad1c23be8e8",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 是一项保护超过 25% 福布斯 500 强企业的行为安全服务，已部署 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）。Abnormal AI 将其用于支持其实时内联电子邮件威胁检测的代理。这些系统目前在生产环境中运行，每日处理数十亿条消息，并以相同的规模执行代理驱动的代码，以在消息进入收件箱之前实时检测并阻止威胁。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "217d3db9286231ee",
      "translationZh": "这项工作是 Abnormal AI 构建软件方式的一部分。如今，他们 80% 的代码更改是通过某种方式使用代理构建的，而 40% 的代码是由后台代理端到端构建的（完全由 AI 构建，而非 AI 辅助）。他们在威胁检测中使用 AgentCore Code Interpreter 体现了相同的 AI 原生方法，该方法已应用于他们的生产运行时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "901600c8c1200fae",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将分享 Abnormal AI 如何构建这些系统的架构、其沙箱方法背后的设计决策，以及为大规模部署 Code Interpreter 的构建者提供的实用经验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53f3cb4b187dbc05",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "834edef09449402f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter 提供了一个完全托管的、无服务器的运行时，供代理动态执行代码。主要特性包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9afd79667b97612",
      "translationZh": "临时 MicroVM 会话：可配置的生存时间（TTL）从 15 分钟（默认）到 8 小时，用于长时间运行的任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af377939baa4dfce",
      "translationZh": "安全：会话在安全的沙箱中运行，在主机操作系统级别实现完全隔离，旨在帮助防止会话之间的意外泄露。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a1067e500838cf3",
      "translationZh": "灵活的网络：可配置为沙盒虚拟私有云（VPC）模式，或公共互联网访问。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f3b8d787b48991b",
      "translationZh": "文件处理：通过 API 直接最多可达 100 MB，或连接到 Amazon Simple Storage Service（Amazon S3）以处理更大的数据集。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9498ff942fd8dce9",
      "translationZh": "预加载运行时：包含常见可视化、统计和数据处理库的 Python 和 Node.js 环境。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb380a52a3222ae4",
      "translationZh": "内置可观测性：日志发送至 Amazon CloudWatch 和 AWS CloudTrail 以进行监控。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db2c10a31d93be94",
      "translationZh": "关键的是，Code Interpreter 以 API 的形式暴露。这意味着它不会规定代理的工作流。相反，它提供了一个框，代理可以在其中运行命令、上传文件并检索结果。对于已有代理基础设施的团队，这种即插即用的设计使得集成变得直接。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39fa6261e48b76ff",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Code Interpreter 架构，其中代理调用 Code Interpreter API 来配置临时 MicroVM 沙盒会话，用于代码执行、文件输入和输出以及结果检索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "664b785af7e3965a",
      "translationZh": "为什么代理需要一个计算暂存区",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44640ed9f6758139",
      "translationZh": "大型语言模型（LLM）在推理和语义连贯性方面表现出色，但许多真实世界的操作并不映射到语义推理：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f798b4f55d70d5fd",
      "translationZh": "基本数学和计数：“我们在过去一小时内检测到多少封钓鱼邮件？”需要计算，而不是语言生成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06a1491f620000dd",
      "translationZh": "数据处理和可视化：将原始数据转换为图表、PDF 或结构化报告。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c18f9472e131d2d8",
      "translationZh": "代码验证：运行单元测试、linting 和集成测试以验证代理生成的输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4789f065649a8a1e",
      "translationZh": "通过将大型语言模型与 Code Interpreter 配对，您可以增强代理的能力，超越仅靠推理所能达到的水平。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cd3a8ceafd6f591",
      "translationZh": "“几乎任何代理，无论是否编写代码，都需要一个代码解释器沙箱，使其能够实际处理数据并得出答案。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ed6985831a68126",
      "translationZh": "— Shrivu Shankar，Abnormal AI 人工智能战略副总裁",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e6e2ac9ba394e470",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 的架构：十亿级邮件规模的三层检测",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4f53e76782f36b",
      "translationZh": "Abnormal AI 通过三层检测架构处理数十亿封电子邮件消息，如图 2 所示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e33ba9271513449c",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Abnormal AI 的三层电子邮件检测管道，其中第 1 层（heuristics，每日数十亿），第 2 层（machine learning models，每日数百万），第 3 层（带有 Code Interpreter 的内联代理，每日数万），每层处理前一层不确定的逐渐更难的案例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "925d6367770ca342",
      "translationZh": "第 1 层 — 高容量轻量级分类（每日数十亿）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d937d8762c0889f3",
      "translationZh": "Small models、heuristic rules、lightweight classifiers (logistic regressions) 处理最大流量。在此规模下，运行更大的模型既成本过高又不必要。大多数消息可以在不进行深度分析的情况下进行分类。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf1cbc18eb06d4",
      "translationZh": "第 2 层 — 中等模型用于不确定的案例（每日数百万）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2e0ec7d674e7ee2",
      "translationZh": "第 1 层不确定的消息会流入深度学习和机器学习（ML）模型，这些模型执行更多的行为信号分析。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61bf7586b2c55fcd",
      "translationZh": "第 3 层 — 带有 Code Interpreter 的内联代理（每日数万）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dca9c7d3896d5cbc",
      "translationZh": "最难的案例通常需要人工分析师进行评估，这些案例由 inline agents 处理。这些代理接收 threat intelligence data 并使用 sandbox 进行分析，动态编写脚本。然后他们评估其如何融入整体 behavioral model 并作出判断。Misclassifications 由一个独立的系统处理，该系统会学习并改进整体系统。多种 monitoring systems 验证实时系统。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7dfd4e713e158454",
      "translationZh": "分析师代理 — 批量情报",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0626e9b419e1909e",
      "translationZh": "除了图 2 所示的实时分类流水线之外，Abnormal 还部署了一个以批处理模式运行的分析代理（图 3）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4e60d053f354d9b",
      "translationZh": "从其检测管道中摄取误分类和调优信号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4b015b5f9267285",
      "translationZh": "在大规模消息集合中识别模式和趋势。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c20c8a31241c3c0b",
      "translationZh": "自主为 Tier 1 编写候选启发式草稿，在 Abnormal AI 自身的检测管道特征和信号上运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "085e81fbeb36000c",
      "translationZh": "Tier 2 的改进模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c58352754a2bd5e1",
      "translationZh": "每周大约运行 100 个批处理作业的规模。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1fbbe5bb68acf54",
      "translationZh": "图 3：分析代理反馈循环，其中批处理代理从实时管道摄取误分类，使用 Code Interpreter 会话分析模式，并将改进的启发式和模型反馈回 Tier 1 和 Tier 2。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ac3fd8760931dd1",
      "translationZh": "这些批处理作业可以在整个过程中保持 Code Interpreter 会话，运行时间超过 30 分钟。它们也可以跨越一天的操作，期间代理间歇性地使用 Code Interpreter。例如，它会运行一个会话，在外部训练一个模型，然后重新调用 Code Interpreter 来处理结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
